 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Propose and discuss",
   "texto": [
    "**Давайте обсудим** (we discuss) proposes a joint action and can address several people or a person in formal treatment. In this pattern, **давайте** is followed by a perfect first-person form: **обсудим**. **Обсуждать** presents the discussion as a regular process or activity; **обсудить** presents it as an action seen together, without asserting in itself that a solution is reached.",
    "**Назначить** may mean setting a date or naming someone for a post: **Совещание назначено на четверг** (the meeting is set for Thursday). The participle is consistent with the Russian noun: **совещание назначено** (neutral), **встреча назначена** (feminine)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "All right and with whom",
   "texto": [
    "**Я согласен** (I agree, man) and **Я согласна** (woman). Who you agree with is said with **с** + instrumental: **Я согласен с тобой** (I agree with you).",
    "The delivery time is expressed with **срок**: **Срок отчёта — пятница** (the reporting time is Friday)."
   ]
